:R-HSA-428359  a            obo:GO_0043488 , owl:NamedIndividual ;
        rdfs:comment        "Insulin-like Growth Factor-2 mRNA Binding Proteins (IGF2BPs) bind specific sets of RNA and regulate their translation, stability, and subcellular localization. IGF2BP1, IGF2BP2, and IGF2BP3 bind about 8400 protein-coding transcripts. The target RNAs contain the sequence motif CAUH (where H is A, U, or, C) and binding of IGFBPs increases the stability of the target RNAs." ;
        rdfs:label          "Insulin-like Growth Factor-2 mRNA Binding Proteins (IGF2BPs/IMPs/VICKZs) bind RNA" ;
        dc:contributor      "Authored: May, B, 2009-07-04" , "Edited: May, B, 2009-07-04" , "Reviewed: Chao, JA, 2010-05-30" , "GOC:reactome_curators" , "Reviewed: Singer, RH, 2010-05-30" ;
        dc:date             "2023-06-21" ;
